<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MARK</book>
  <para style="h">MARAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwena Maber ma Marako Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwena Maber ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARAKO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Kwena Maber ma Marako </char> ocoyo cake ki lok ma kit man ni, “Man aye Kwena Maber ma mako kom Yecu Kricito, Wod pa Lubanga.” Marako onyutu Yecu macalo ngat ma latic dok tye ki twero. Twerone onen ki i pwonye, ryemo cen, ki weko bal pa dano. Yecu bene oloko pire kene ni en i Wod pa Dano ma obino pi miyo kwone me koko dano ki ibalgi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marako onyutu kwo pa Yecu i yo ma atir dok ki diro. En ocano kore ki kore kun keto gin ma Yecu otimo, macalo gin ma dok pire dit loyo loke ki pwonye. I nge lok manok ikom Jon Labatija, atematema ki batija pa Yecu, Marako ocito atir i tic pa Yecu me cango lutwo ki pwonyo dano me ngeyo Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikare ma Yecu mede ki tice, jo malube gucako ngeyo en maber adada ento lumone ne gucako doko mager ikome.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dul ma giko me buk man tito pi kare me agiki pa Yecu iwi lobo, tone ikom Yatariya, cer ne ki ilyel ki doke i polo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Acaki me Kwena Maber <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Yecu ikin lwak i Galilaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu oa ki Galilaya ocito i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cabit me agiki i Jerucalem ki kabedo ma orumu Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1—15:47</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cer pa Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nyute pa Yecu ki inge cerne ki dong doke i Polo <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Tito lok pa Jon Labatija</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Man aye Kwena Maber ma mako kom Yecu Kricito, Wod pa Lubanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note> Kwena ne cake kit ma kicoyo kwede i buk pa lanebi Icaya ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Nen, abicwalo lakwenana bitelo nyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">ma bigero yoni.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ica 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dwon dano mo ma dange ki i tim ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Wuger yo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">wutir yone ocung atir.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Kitmeno, Jon Labatija onen i tim, kun batija dano dok bene tito lok ni; “Wungut wek ki batijawu, wek Lubanga owek balwu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Jo mapol ma i lobo Judaya ducu ki jo mapol ma i Jerucalem gucito bote. Gutucu balgi, ci en obatijagi i kulu Jordan.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Luk 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jon onongo ruku bongo ma kiyubu ki yer kinaga, ka tweyo pyere ki del, kun camo bonyo ki moo kic ma i tim. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />En obedo katito lok kun waco ni, “Tye dano mo ma obibino kun lubu kora makato an ki dit, ma an pe aromo gungo piny ka gonyo del war tyene. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />An abatijawu ki pii, ento en bibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleng.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jon obatija Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ikare meno Yecu oa ki i Najaret matye i Galilaya obino bot Jon, ci Jon obatija en i kulu Jordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ka Yecu oa woko ki i pii, otugi neno ka polo yabe, ki Cwiny Maleng ka tye kabino kun lyane piny macalo akuri ci opye ikome. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aca 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Jab 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ica 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mar 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> Ci dwon ocako winye ma a ki i polo kun waco ni, “In aye i Woda ma amaro, ma cwinya yom ikomi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Catan obito Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Cutcut Cwiny Maleng otero Yecu woko wa i tim. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ci en obedo i tim nino pyere angwen kun lumalaika gubedo ka konye. Catan ocako bite, ikare meno ma en onongo tye i tim ikin lee me tim.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocako tice i Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:1-3">Jon 4:1-3</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 4:43">43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ikare ma kimako Jon kitweyo i buc, Yecu ocito i Galilaya kun tito lok me Kwena Maber ma a ki bot Lubanga; <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3:2</ref></char></note> kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Kare dong oromo, ker pa Lubanga onyiko cok; wungut, wuye lok me Kwena Maber.”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo lucik rec angwen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ka Yecu onongo woto rabo dog nam me Galilaya, ci oneno Cimon ki omine Anderiya, ka gitye ka bolo obwo recgi i nam; pien gin lumak rec. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yecu olwongogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubin wulub kora, ci an abimiyowu wudoko lumak dano.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ci cutcut gutugi weko obwogi, gulubu kore. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ka dok guwoto anyim manok, ci oneno Yakobo ki omine Jon, gin awobe pa Jebedayo, ma onongo gitye i yeya ka tudu wang obwo recgi. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />En otugi lwongogi, ci cutcut gin bene guweko won gi Jebedayo odong ki lutice i yeya, gucako lubu kore.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano matye ki cen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Gucako cito wa i Kapernaum, ci cutcut i ceng Cabit Yecu ki lupwonyene odonyo i kacoke, ci ocako pwonyo lwak. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note> Dano guuru kit pwonye matek, pien opwonyogi macalo won twero, pe macalo Lupwonycik. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ci cutcut dano mo matye ki cen otugi nen i kacoke; <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />ocako dange matek ni, “Ilaro gin ango kwedwa kaa, in Yecu Lanajaret? Dong ibino ka tyekowa bo? An angeyi, in i dano maleng pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ento Yecu ojuke, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ling mot, a woko ki ikome!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Cen marac ojake ki koko matek, ka oa woko ki ikome. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Dano ducu guuru matek, kun gipenye keken gi ni, “Man gin ango? Man aye dok kit pwony manyen bo? Nen en ka ciko wa cen maracugu ki twero, ci gin bene giwinyo doge” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ci pire oywek oromo kabedo ducu murumu lobo Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango maro pa Cimon Petero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Mat 8:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luk 4:38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ci cutcut gua woko ki i kacoke, gudonyo i ot pa Petero ki Anderiya, gunywako wot kacel ki Yakobo ki Jon. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Maro pa Petero onongo tye ki two lyeto, obutu piny, ci cutcut gutito pire bot Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yecu ocito omako cinge otinge kwede malo, ci two lyeto ocang woko ki ikome, ka ocako gwokogi.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango jo mapol i otyeno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Mat 8:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Luk 4:40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ki i otyeno ma ceng dong opoto, gucako kelo bote lutwo ducu ma komgi lit, ki jo ma cen omakogi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Jo ducu ma i taun madit gucoke i dogola. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Ci Yecu ocango lutwo mapol ma onongo gitye ki kwa two mapatpat, kun ryemo ki lwak cen mapol; pe oye cen mo oloko, pien onongo gingeye.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito lok i Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Odiko con ma piny pud col, Yecu oa malo, ci opuk ocito woko wa i kabedo kama dano peke iye, ci obedo kalego Lubanga kunu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Cimon ki jo ma gitye kwede gucako lubu kore; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ka gunonge ci guwaco ni, “Dano ducu gitye ka yenyi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />En Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Dok wakobu woko i taun madito mukene matye cok ki kany, wek acit atit lok kunu bene; pien meno en aye gin ma omiyo abino.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref></char></note> Ci Yecu owoto orumu lobo Galilaya ducu, kun woto ki tito lok i kacokegi ki ryemo cen mapol bene.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango ladobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ladobo mo obino bot Yecu, kun orumu conge piny obako doge bote, ci olege ni, “Ka i mito, itwero canga.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ci kica omako Yecu ikome, ocako ryeyo cinge ogudu kome, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Amito; komi ocang.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ci cutcut dobo ocang ki ikome, kome odoko leng. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yecu ocike matek, ka ocwale kwede ocito. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref></char></note> Ocike ni, <char style="wj">“Winy ba, pe icitit ki dano mo; ento ber icit ci inyute keni bot ajwaka pa Lubanga, wek imii gityer pi komi madong ocangi, kit mayam Moses ociko, wek obed lanyut botgi.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ento en ocito, ocako tito loke atyer bot lwak, ci loke oywek. Pieno omiyo Yecu pe dong twero donyo i taun mo kamaleng; ocako bedo i kabedo ma dano peke iye, ento lwak gumol gucito bote ma gua ki i kabedo ducu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano matye ki two akweya kom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ka nino okato manok, Yecu odwogo i Kapernaum, ci pire owinye ni en tye paco. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ci lwak gucoke kacel, ma kabedo odoko ding, ma pe romogi. Ot opong wa i dogola; kun en obedo katito lok botgi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Jo mogo gukelo bote dano ma twoyo two akweya kom. Co angwen aye onongo gutingo en. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ka yoo me tere inyim Yecu oloyogi pi lwak, ci guyabo wi ot ki malo ma opime ki kama Yecu tye iye. Ma gutyeko mukune ci gucwalo kitara ma latwo obutu iye piny inyime. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ikare ma Yecu oneno niyegi, ci owaco bot latwo ni, <char style="wj">“Latina, bali dong kiweko woko.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Cutcut Lupwonycik mogo, ma onongo gin tye kunu, gubedo ka pyem keken gi wa i cwinygi ni, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Dano man loko kuman pingo? En oyeto Lubanga! Anga matwero weko bal kono ngat acel keken, en aye Lubanga?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Oyotoyot Yecu ocako niang ki i cwinye kene ni gitye ki pyem ma kitmeno i cwinygi. Ci en openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo cwinywu tye ka pyem i lok macalo man?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" /><char style="wj">Lok mayote tye kwene ka awaco bot latwo ni, ‘Bali dong kiweko woko’, kono nyo ni, ‘Aa malo wek iting kabutuni, icit wa paco’?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" /><char style="wj">Ento kombedi abinyutu botwu ni Wod pa dano tye ki twero me weko bal iwi lobo.”</char> Ci cut owaco bot latwo akweya kom ni, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" /><char style="wj">“An awaco ni, a malo, iting kabutuni, icit giri paco.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />En ocako a malo, otingo kabutune oyotoyot, ocito woko ki inyimgi. Man omiyo gin ducu guuru tutwal. Gucako pako Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Ma naka yam peya waneno kit gin macalo man.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yecu dok ocito i dog nam Galilaya; ci lwak ducu gubino bote, ocako pwonyogi. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ka okato i yoo, ci oneno Levi, wod pa Alipayo, ka obedo piny ka jogo mucoro, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Luba.”</char> Ci oa malo, olubu kore.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ingeye cutcut Yecu obedo piny i ot pa Levi. Lujog mucoro ducu ki lubalo gubino gubedo piny kacel ki lupwonyene. Jo mapol ma kitmeno onongo gubedo ka lube. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Lupwonycik ma ikin Luparicayo, ka guneno ni en tye ka cam kacel ki lubalo ki lujog mucoro, gupeny lupwonyene ni, “Pingo en camo kacel ki lujog mucoro ki lubalo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yecu owinyo ci ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Jo ma komgi yot pe gimito daktar, pe abino kalwongo jo ma kitgi atir, ento lubalo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom rii kec</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lupwonye pa Jon ki pa Luparicayo onongo gitye ka rii kec. Jo mogo gubino gupenye ni, “Pingo lupwonye pa Jon ki pa Luparicayo giri kec, ento lupwonyeni pe giri kec?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Lurem lanyom twero rii kec ma kun lanyom tye kwedgi? Pi kare ducu ma lanyom tye kwedgi pe gitwero rii kec.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" /><char style="wj">Ento kare bibino ma gibikwanyo lanyom woko ki botgi, ka dong gibiri kec ikare meno.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo ma dabo bongo manyen ikom ginaruka ma otii. Ka otimo kitmeno, ci kiraka ma gidabo kwede ni telo bongo meno; en manyen ni jung woko ki kom ma otii, ci wang bongo yec mede.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo ma piko kongo bwino manyen i opiru macon; ka opiko, ci kongo meno biyeco opiru woko, kongo bio woko, ki opiru bene bibale. Ento kongo bwino manyen myero kipik i opiru manyen.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lapeny ma mako ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nwo 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> I ceng Cabit mo Yecu obedo kawot kun ngolo ki dye poto ngano, ma gitye kawot, lupwonyene gucako rito wit ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Luparicayo gupenye ni, “Pingo lupwonyeni gitiyo gin ma cik okwero ni pe giti i ceng Cabit?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Cam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> En odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wukwano gin ma Daudi otiyo ikare ma kec neke marac, en ki jo matye kacel kwede?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit ma en odonyo kwede i Ot pa Lubanga ikare ma Abiatar aye ajwaka madit pa Lubanga? Ocamo mugati ma giketo inyim Lubanga, mayam Cik okwero ni dano mo pe ocam, kono ajwaki pa Lubanga keken. Daudi ocamo, dok opoko ki jo matye bote.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Ci Yecu otito botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ceng Cabit giketo pi dano, pe dano aye giketo pi ceng Cabit.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" /><char style="wj">Kumeno Wod pa dano aye Rwot me ceng Cabit.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Labade otal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yecu dok odonyo i kacoke, kama onongo tye iye laco mo ma bade otal. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Gukiye ka nyo bicange i ceng Cabit, wek gikel lok ikome. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yecu owaco bot labade otal ni, <char style="wj">“A malo icung idyere.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“I ceng Cabit, Cik ye ni kitim iye gin maber nyo gin marac, gilar iye kwo nyo ginek woko?”</char> Ento gin guling alinga. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />En olworo wange ikomgi ki kiniga, cwinye ocwer pi nwang cwinygi. Owaco bot laco meno ni, <char style="wj">“Rye badi.”</char> Labade otal oryeyo bade ci bade ocang cut. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Luparicayo gukato woko, cutcut gucako poro lok kacel ki jo pa Kerode kit ma myero gineke kwede.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak gucoke i dog nam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yecu ki lupwonyene gua gucito i dog nam. Lwak madwong ma gua ki i Galilaya gulube ki jo ma gua ki i Judaya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ki i Jerucalem, ki Idumea ki loka Jordan, ki i lobo ma orumu Turo ki Cidon. Lwak madwong gucoke bote, pien guwinyo pi tic mapol ma en otiyo. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mar 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref></char></note> En ociko lupwonye ni guyub yeya matidi pire, wek pe lwak gubed ka diyo en.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesu teaching from the boat" file="CN01705B.TIF" size="col" loc="Mark 3:9" copy="David C. Cook" ref="3:9">Yecu tye kapwony ki i yeya</figure> <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Pien onongo ocango jo mapol, ci oweko dano ducu ma komgi lit gudiine ikome kabonge. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ka cen guneno, ci guryebe inyime, ki koko kun giwaco ni, “In giri Wod pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yecu ojukugi ni pe omyero guwek dano ongeye.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oyero Lukwena apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yecu oito malo iwi got, ocako lwongo jo ma en mito ni gubed bote. Gin gucito bote. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ocako yero jo apar wiye aryo wek gubed kacel kwede, dok wek eorgi gubed lukwena me tito lok, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />dok gubed ki twero me ryemo cen. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Mukwongo Cimon ma en ocako nyinge Petero; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />ki Yakobo wod pa Jebedayo, ki Jon omin Yakobo, ma en ocako nyinggi ni Boanergi, ma te loke ni, jo ma gimor calo kot; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />ki Anderiya ki Pilipo ki Bartolomayo ki Matayo, ki Tomaci, ki Yakobo wod pa Alipayo, ki Tadayo, ki Cimon ma obedo ikin jo ma gimito locken, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ki Juda me Keriot, mayam oloke odobe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 3:19">Yecu ki Beeljebul</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 3:19">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:19">Ma Yecu odok paco, <verse eid="MRK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />lwak dok gucoke, omiyo en ki lupwonyene pe gitwero nongo kare me cam. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ma jo tugi guwinyo, ci gubino ka make pien giwaco ni, “En opo woko.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> Lupwonycik ma gua i Jerucalem guwaco ni, “En tye ki jok Beeljebul,” dok ni, “En ryemo cen pi twero pa ladit pa cen.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yecu olwongogi bote, oloko kwedgi i carolok ni, <char style="wj">“Catan twero ryemo Catan ningning?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" /><char style="wj">Ker ka opoke iye aryo, ker meno pe twero cung.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" /><char style="wj">Dok ot ka iye opoke aryo, ot meno pe twero cung.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" /><char style="wj">Dok ka Catan ocako lweny ikome kekene ce opoke kene, ci pe twero cung, kerne gik woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" /><char style="wj">Ento pe tye ngat mo matwero donyo i ot pa dano ma kome tek ka yako jamine; ento kong kwongo tweyo dano ma kome teki, ka dong biyako jamine ma i ode.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, bal ducu ma dano timo, ki lok ducu ma giyeto kwede Lubanga, gibiwekone woko,</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ento ngat ma yeto Cwiny Maleng pe kibiweko bale matwal, pien nongo otimo bal ma rii nakanaka.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yecu oloko man pien onongo gin guwaco ni, “En tye ki cen.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Min Yecu ki omegi Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mine ki omegine gubino, gucung woko, gucwalo kwena me lwonge. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Lwak onongo gubedo kun gurume dyere. Guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Nen, meni ki omegi gitye woko, kayenyi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />En openyo ni, <char style="wj">“Maa ki omega gin angagi?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Olworo wange ikom jo ma gurume ma gubedo piny, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Maa ki omega gin ene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" /><char style="wj">Dano ma tiyo gin ma Lubanga mito, en aye omera, ki lamera, ki maa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lacokodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu dok ocako pwony i dog nam. Lwak madwong tutwal gucoke bote; pimeno en odonyo iyeya, obedo piny i iye ki i dye nam, lwak ducu gubedo iwi tura. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Opwonyogi ki lok mapol i carolok. I pwonye en owaco ni: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" /><char style="wj">“Wuwiny! Lacokodi ocito ka coyo kodi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" /><char style="wj">Ka kun coyo, kodi mogo okir i yoo, winyo gubino, gucamo woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikom pata kama ngom tye iye manok. Cutcut gutwi, kama ngome pe tut.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" /><char style="wj">Ka ceng oryeny, owangogi gutwo woko, pien lwitgi pe odonyo matut.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikin okutu, okutu olot odiyogi woko, pe gunyako nyiggi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir i ngom maber, gutwi, gujany, gunyako nyiggi, mukene pyere adek, mukene pyere abicel, mukene miya.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yecu odolo loke kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat matye ki it me winyone, owiny.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom carolok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ikare ma Yecu odong kene, ci jo murume dyere kacel ki jone apar wiye aryo ni, gubino gupenye lok ikom carolok meno. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />En ogonyo botgi tere ni, <char style="wj">“Wun gimiyowu ngec me ngeyo mung me ker pa Lubanga, ento bot jo mukene ma gitye woko kiloko kwedgi i carolok,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Ica 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">wek ka gineno, gunen, ento pe guniang maber, dok ka giwinyo, guwiny, ento pe guniang tere maber; wek pe guloke gudwog cen bot Lubanga, owek balgi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito te carolok ikom lacokodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wuniang te carolok man? Wubiniang ningning carolok ducu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" /><char style="wj">Lacoo kodi coyo lok pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" /><char style="wj">Kodi ma okir i yoo, meno aye jo ma winyo lok pa Lubanga, ka guwinyo, cutcut Catan bino, kwanyo lok ma kicoyo i igi woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno kodi ma okir i ngom ma obedo pata; gin aye jo ma giwinyo lok, oyotoyot gimako lok ki yomcwiny;</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" /><char style="wj">ento pe gitye ki lwitgi igi, giri pi kare manok; ka can obino, nyo libo dano ocake, pi lok meno, cutcut gipoto woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene ma okir ikin okutu; gin aye jo ma giwinyo lok,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" /><char style="wj">ento paro lok me lobo man, ki maro lonyo, ki miti me jami mukene, ka odonyo i cwinygi ci diyo gi, pe ginyak.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" /><char style="wj">Ento kodi mukene ma okir i ngom maber ni, gin aye jo ma giwinyo lok, ci gigamo, ginyako nyiggi, mukene pyere adek, mukene pyere abicel, mukene miya.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mac tara ma kiumu ki aduku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Tara mono kikelo i ot me auma ki aduku, nyo me aketa ite kitanda? Pe kicibo kamalenge iwi lacib tara?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien pe tye gin mo ma okane ma pe bingene, kadi gin ma kiumu ma pe binen kamaleng.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" /><char style="wj">Ka ngat mo tye ki it me winyone, owiny.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk 6:38</ref></char>
    </note> Ci dok owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom lok ma wuwinyo. Lapim ma wupimo kwede jami, en aye kibipimo ki megwu bene, dok kibimedone botwu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ngat ma gire mo tye, kibimede, ngat ma gire mo pe kibikwanyo woko ki bote kadi wa gin ma en tye kwede ducu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom twi pa kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ker pa Lubanga tye kit man, macalo dano ma coyo kodi i ngom.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" /><char style="wj">En butu piny i dyewor, dok a i dyeceng, ci kodi cako twi, dongo, kun en pe ngeyo kit ma time kwede.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" /><char style="wj">Ngom kene aye miyo kodi nyako nyige; mukwongo kong twi, lacen ngok, ka nyige core.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ka bel ocek, ci dano cako kayone cut, pien nongo kare me kac dong oromo.” </char><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom kodi karadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wabiporo ker pa Lubanga ki kit gin ango? Nyo wabinyutu ki kit carolok ango?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" /><char style="wj">Ker pa Lubanga rom ki kodi karadali; ka kicoyo i ngom, kadi bed en tidi tutwal makato kodi ducu ma iwi loboni,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" /><char style="wj">ento ka kicoyo, ci dongo, doko dit makato yadi ducu, jange jany madito, miyo winyo me polo gigero odigi ite tipu jange.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Otito botgi lok i carolok mapol calo meno, kit ma gitwero niang kwede. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Pe oloko kwedgi labongo carolok, ento ka en tye ki lupwonyene, ci gonyo telok ducu botgi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ojuku yamo i nam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Inino meno ma piny dong oyutu, Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wakatu loka ca.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Guweko lwak, ci gukwango en ki yeya ma onongo en tye iye ni; ki yeya mukene bene onongo tye kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Yamo madwong ocako kodo, pii otwage, ocore i yeya, omiyo i yeya ocako pong woko. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Ento en onongo tye i yeya itung i ngeye, kun onino ikom laten wic. Gucoye, guwaco ni, “Lapwony, in pe iparo? Nen, wato woko do.” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />En ocako co woko ci ojuku yamo, owaco ki nam ni, <char style="wj">“Ling, pye mot.”</char> Yamo ocako kwe, nam oling litik. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wulwor kit man? Wun pe wutye ki niye?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Gubedo ki lworo madwong, ci gucako penye keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Man anga kaa, ma yamo ki nam giwinye ni?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano matye ki cen i Geraca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Gin guo i loka nam tungcel, i lobo pa Lugeraca. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ka Yecu okato woko ki i yeya, ci cutcut dano mo matye ki cen obino bote, ma oa ki i kabedo kama kiyiko iye jo ma oto. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />En onongo bedo ikin lyel, pe tye dano mo matwero tweyo en kadi ki nyor; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />pien yam kitweye tyen mapol ki atego ki nyor, ento ocodo nyor, oturu atego woko. Pe onongo tye dano mo matye ki kero ma loye. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Nino ducu, dyewor ki dyeceng, en bedo ikin lyel ki iwi cere kun kok, dok ngolo kome kekene ki kidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ka oneno Yecu ki kamabor, ci oringo, oryebe inyime, owore. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Ci odange ki dwon malongo ni, “Ilaro ango kweda, Yecu Wod pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal? Akwonge ki nying Lubanga, pe iyela.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Pien onongo ocike ni, <char style="wj">“A woko ki ikom dano man, in cen.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Nyingi anga?”</char> Ogamo ni, “Nyinga Legion, pien wapol.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />En obako doge bote matek ni, pe omyero ocwalgi woko ki i lobo meno. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Lwak opego mapol onongo gitye ka cam i kor got kunu; <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />gubako doggi bote kun giwaco ni, “Cwalwa i opego, wek wadony igi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yecu oye ki gin. Cen marac gua ki ikome, gudonyo i opego, lwak opego ma gimito romo ka alip aryo, gutware ki ngwec gucore i longo got, gumwony woko i nam.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Lukwat guringo gutito loke i taun madit, ki ikin paco. Dano mapol gumol gubino kaneno gin ma otime. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Gubino bot Yecu, guneno laco mayam tye ki cen. Obedo piny, oruku bongo, odoko ryek, en mayam onongo tye ki dul mony me cen ni. Piman lworo ocako makogi. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Jo ma guneno gutito botgi lok ducu ma otime ikom dano mayam tye ki cen ikomeni, ki gin ma otime ikom opego ni. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Gubako doggi bot Yecu ni myero oa woko ki i lobo tugi.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yecu ka dong tye kaito i yeya, ci dano mayam tye ki cen ikomeni obako doge bot Yecu ni myero ebed bote. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ento Yecu okwero woko, owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Dok paco bot lutuwu, i cit itit gin madit ma Rwot otimo ikomi, ki kit ma otimi kwede kica.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />En ocito, ocako tito lok madit ma Yecu otimo ikome i Dekapoli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5:20 </char><char style="fk">Dekapoli </char> te loke ni taun apar.</note> omiyo jo ducu guuru.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya pa Yairo ki dako ma ogudu dog bongo pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-50">Luk 8:40-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ka Yecu dong okato loka nam tung ca, lwak madwong gucoke bote; en obedo i dog nam. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ngat acel ma ikin ludito me kacoke ma nyinge Yairo obino; ka onene, ci oryebe piny katyene, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />obako doge bote matek ni, “Nyara matidi cok to woko. Bin iket cingi ikome wek ocang, obed makwo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yecu ocito kacel kwede, kun lwak madwong gilube, kun gidiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Onongo tye dako mo madong otwoyo two agoba mwaka apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />En olimo can madwong ki bot ludaktar mapol; olanyo lime ducu ma pe okonye ento twone mede ameda. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ka owinyo lok ikom Yecu, obino ki i ngeye ki ikin lwak, ci ogudu dog ginarukane; <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />pien otamo ni, “Ka agudu kadi kom ginarukane keken, ci abicang.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Oyotoyot two agobine ocang woko, ci ongeyo ki ikome kene ni dong ecang woko ki i two ne. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ka Yecu ongeyo ki ikome ni teko oa ki ikome, ci oloke i dye lwak cut, openyo ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ma ogudu ginarukana?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Lupwonyene gugamo ni, “Ineno lwak tye ka diyo in, ka dok pud ipenyo ni, ‘Anga ma oguda?’” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ci olworo wange wek enen ngat ma ogudeni. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ci dako meno, ka ongeyo kit gin ma otime ikome, obino bot Yecu ki lworo, kun kome myel, oryebe inyime, otite lok ducu me ada. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nyara, niye ni ocangi. Wot ki kuc, two ni dong otyeko cang matwal.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ka Yecu pud loko, jo mogo gubino ma gua ki i ot pa ladit me kacoke, guwaco ni, “Nyari dong oto woko, pud dok iyelo Lapwony pingo?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yecu pe oketo cwinye ikom lok ma guwaco, ento ociko ladit me kacoke ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ilwor, in iye meri ayeya keken.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Pe oye dano mo olube, kono nyo Petero ki Yakobo ki Jon omin Yakobo keken. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Gubino i ot pa ladit me kacoke, Yecu oneno lwak ma giwoo, kun gikok ma gidange matek. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ka odonyo i ot, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wuwo ki koko? Latin man peya oto, ento onino anina.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Gunyere matek, ci Yecu oryemogi ducu woko, ocako tero won latin ki mine ki jo ma onongo gitye kacel kwede, gudonyo kama latin tye iye. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Omako cing latin nyako, owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Talita kum,” </char> ma teloke ni, “Latin anyaka, awaco ni, a malo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Oyotoyot nyako oa malo, owoto, pien onongo mwaka me dite dong romo apar wiye aryo. Guuru matek tutwal. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yecu ocikogi matek ni ngat mo pe myero onge lok man; ka dong ocikogi ni gimi ki nyako ni gin acama mo ocam.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kikwero Yecu i Najaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yecu oa woko ki kunu, odok i lobo tugi, lupwonyene gulube. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ocako pwonyogi i kacoke i ceng Cabit. Jo mapol ma guwinye, guuru, kun giwaco ni, “Laco man onongo ryeko man ducu ki kwene? Kit ryeko ango ma kimiye ni? Dok kit tic ango matek madito marom man ma en tiyogi ni? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Man pe lapac, wod pa Maliam, omin Yakobo, ki Yoce, ki Juda ki Cimon? Dok nyimegine pe gitye botwa kany?” Ci cwinygi ocako a woko ikome. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jon 4:44</ref></char></note> Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Lanebi kiketo deyo ikome, ento pe kiketo deyo ikome ki i lobo tugi ki ikin jo tugi, ki i ode.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Pe otiyo tic matego kunu, ento oketo cinge ikom lutwo mogo keken, ci gucang. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yecu ouru pien pe gitye ki niye. En obedo kawire ikin gangi kun pwonyo dano.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ooro lupwonye apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yecu olwongo bote lupwonyene apar wiye aryo, ci oorogi ki aryo aryo, omiyogi twero ikom cen. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref></char></note> Ocikogi matek ni pe guwot ki gin mo, kono odo keken, labongo cam mo, kadi opiru, kadi lim mo i del pyergi; <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />ento guwot kun giruku war tyen gi, pe guwot ma gubamo kanyi aryo ikomgi. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka wudonyo i ot mo, wubed kenyo nio ka wubia ki i kabedo meno.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Tic 13:51</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kabedo ducu ma pe bijolowu, onyo biwinyowu, kace wubia woko ki kunu, ci wuteng apwa woko ki i tyenwu wek obed caden botgi.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kitmeno gucako cito, gutito lok ni myero dano onguti. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak 5:14</ref></char></note> Guryemo lwak cen mapol, dok guwiro lutwo mapol ki moo kun gicangogi.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Jon Labatija</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot Kerode owinyo pire, pien onongo nying Yecu dong oywek tutwal. Jo mogo guwaco ni, “Jon Labatija aye ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto; en aye ma omiyo lakit teko macalo meno tye katic ikome.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ento jo mukene guwaco ni, “En Eliya,” jo mukene ni, “En lanebi, cal ki ngat mo ikin lunebi macon.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ka Kerode owinyo pire ci owaco ni, “Jon mayam atongo wiye en aye ocer woko.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note> Pien Kerode yam ooro dano, gumako Jon, gutweyo ibuc, pi Kerodia ciomine, dako pa Pilipo, mayam okwanyo me bedo dakone. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Pien Jon onongo owaco bot Kerode ni, “Cik pe oye ni ibed ki ciomeru.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kerodia obedo ki kec cwiny ikome, omito neke woko, ento pe otwero, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />pien Kerode onongo lworo Jon, dok onongo ngeyo ni en dano ma kite atir, dok maleng, ci obedo ka gwoke maber. Ka owinyo lok ma en otito, loke otwoyo doge woko, ento pire obedo mit bote kawinyo loke. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ento kare maber oromo inino ma Kerode oyubu iye karama me nipo pi nywale, ci olwongo iye ludito pa miri, ludito wilweny ki ludongo me Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nya pa Kerodia odonyo i ot omyelo, ci oyomo cwiny rwot Kerode ki welone. Rwot owaco bot latin anyaka ni, “Lega gin ducu ma i mito, abimiyi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Okwongo akwonga kun waco ni, “Gin ducu ma ibilega abimiyi, kadi bed nucu kera.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Latin anyaka okato woko, openyo mine ni, “Abilego gin ango?” Odok iye ni, “Leg wi Jon Labatija.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Oyotoyot odwogo i ot bot Rwot ki mit kom, olege ni, “Amito imiya wi Jon Labatija i wee kombedi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Rwot Kerode okumu matek, ento pi kwonge ki pi welone omiyo pe omito twono en. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Oyotoyot rwot ooro acikari ma gwoko en, ocike ni okel wi Jon. Acikari ocito ongolo ngut Jon ki i ot buc, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />okelo wiye i wee, omiyo bot latin anyaka; nyako omiyo bot mine. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ka lupwonye pa Jon guwinyo pire, gucito gutingo kome, guyiko i lyel.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo cam ki jo alip abic</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Lupwonye gudwogo bot Yecu gutite lok ducu ma gutiyo ki ma gupwonyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubin kakenwu kama dano pe iye, wek wuywe manok.”</char> Pien jo mapol onongo gubedo kabino, ki gidok cen, kun gigwenye agwenya, omiyo pe gubedo ki kare mo me cam. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Gucito ken gi ki yeya i kabedo ma dano pe iye. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Jo mapol gunenogi ka gicito, ma gungeyogi, ci guringo kunu ki tyen gi kun gia ki i taun ducu. Gin aye gukwongo oo kunu wiati. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Wel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Luk 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Tek 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eje 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Jek 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref></char></note> Ka Yecu okato iwi tera, oneno lwak madwong; kica ocako make ikomgi, pien gitye macalo romi ma gipeke ki lakwat; ci opwonyogi ki lok mapol. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Ka oo otyeno, ci lupwonyene gubino bote guwaco ni, “Kabedo man tye i dye tim, cawa bene dong okato. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Cwal lwak gucit ikin paco ki i gangi ma cokcok, guwil ginacama pirgi ken gi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ento en odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun aye wumigi ginacama.”</char> Gin gugamo ni, “Wacit wawil mugati me denari miya aryo, wamii botgi wek gucam?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Ento en openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye ki mugati adi? Kong wucit wunen.”</char> Ka gungeyo guwaco ni, “Abic, ki rec aryo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yecu ociko jo ducu ni gubed piny i dul ki dul, ikom lum alita. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Kitmeno lwak gubedo piny i dul ki dul, miya miya, ki pyere abic pyere abic. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Okwanyo mugati abic ki rec aryo, oneno malo i polo olego gum, obaro i mugati, omiyo ki lupwonyene wek guket inyim lwak; dok opoko rec aryo ikin gi ducu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Gin ducu gucamo, guyeng. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ci gucoko ngide mugati ma odong, ki rec bene, opongo aduku apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Jo ma gucamo mugati giromo co alip abic.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu owoto iwi nam ki tyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jon 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Oyotoyot Yecu ociko lupwonyene ni gudony i yeya, gukwong nyime me cito loka nam, wa i Betecaida, pien onongo en pud ciko lwak. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ka dong ocikogi, ci ocito iwi got ka lega. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ka piny oyutu, yeya onongo dong tye wa i dye nam, en kene aye onongo tye iwi tura. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />En onenogi kun gicane ki cero yeya, pien onongo yamo kodo bino ki inyimgi. I kine me koko gweno, en ocako bino botgi kun woto iwi nam ki tyene. Yecu otime macalo mito katogi akata, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ento ma gunene kun woto iwi nam ki tyene, gutamo ni gwok onyo gemo mo, ci gudange matek; <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />pien gin ducu gunene, cwinygi opoto matek. Ento oyotoyot oloko kwedgi kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wudii cwinywu. An enu; gwok wulwor.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Odonyo botgi i yeya, ci yamo oling mot. Gin guuru matek tutwal ki i cwinygi, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />pien nakanen pe guniang lok ma ikom mugati, ento cwinygi pud obedo nwang.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango two i Genecaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ka dong gukato loka nam, ci gukato wi tura i lobo Genecaret, gutweyo yeya kunu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ka gutyeko a woko ki i yeya, ci lwak gungeyo Yecu oyotoyot. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Gucako ringo gurumu kabedo ducu matye kunu, kun gikelo bote lutwo ma gutingogi ki kitara, giterogi i kabedo ducu ma guwinyo ni en tye iye. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />I kabedo ducu mayam en obino iye, ikin paco, taun madito, ki ikin caro, gipyelo lutwo wa i cuk, kun gibako dog gi bote ni oye wek gugud kadi dog ginarukane keken; ci lutwo ducu ma gugudo ginarukane gucang.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kit pwony pa kwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik mogo ma gua ki i Jerucalem gucoke bot Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Guneno jo mogo ma ikin lupwonyene ma pe gilubu pwony me tekwaro, ento gicamo ma pe gulogo cinggi. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Pien Luparicayo ki Lujudaya ducu ka pe gulogo cinggi kakare pe gicamo, pien gumako pwony me tekwaro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lujudaya ducu lwoko cinggi wa i otwenggi</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ka gudwogo ki i cuk pe gicamo, nio ka gulwoke. Dok gitye ki lwak kit pwony mapol ma gin lubu, macalo kit me lwoko kikopo, agulu ki jami mola ducu. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik gupenyo Yecu ni, “Pingo lupwonyeni pe gilubu pwony pa kwariwa? Pingo gicamo ki cinggi ma pe gulogo ma lubu tekwaro” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ica 29:13</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni: <char style="wj">“Wun lugoba, Icaya con oloko ikomwu kakare, macalo en ocoyo ni Lubanga owaco ni:</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">‘Rok man kara giwora ki del doggi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">nono, ento cwinygi pe ikoma wa ki acel;</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />
    <char style="wj">giwora nono,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">pwony ma gipwonyo obedo pwony ma mako kit pa dano.’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />
    <char style="wj">Wuweko cik pa Lubanga, kun wuketo cwinywu kalubu kit pa dano.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yecu dok owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutimo ber pi kwero Cik pa Lubanga, wek wulub giwu kit tekwarowu!</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Nia 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lev 20:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Moses yam owaco ni, ‘Wor woru ki meni’; dok ni, ‘Ka ngat ma oceno wone nyo mine, kibineke woko’;</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" /><char style="wj">ento wun wuwaco ni, ‘Ka dano mo owaco ki wone nyo mine ni, Gin ma kono akonyi kwede en lim me Korban’</char> (teloke ni, gin ma gimiyo ki Lubanga), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" /><char style="wj">en pe dok omii lim mo me konyo wone nyo mine,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" /><char style="wj">kun wumiyo lok pa Lubanga doko goro, pien wupwonyo dano ni gulub kit tekwarowu. Dok wutiyo bene gin mapol macalo meno.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma balo dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yecu dok olwongo lwak bote, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun ducu wuwiny loka, ci wuniang.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" /><char style="wj">Pe tye gin mo ma donyo i dano ma a ki woko matwero balo en, ento gin ma a ki i dano en aye balo dano.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><char style="wj">Ma tye ki it me winyone, owiny.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ka oweko lwak woko, ci odonyo i ot, lupwonyene gucako penye pi carolok meno ma obolo ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />En ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Kara wun bene peya wuniang tere bo? Pe wungeyo ni, gin ducu ma donyo i dano ma a ki woko pe twero balo en?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" /><char style="wj">Pien pe odonyo wa i cwinye, ento wok kato i cin iye, ci kato woko.”</char> (Ka otyeko wacone ki meno, nyutu ni olonyo kwa cam ducu.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yecu dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Gin ma a ki i dano aye balo dano.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" /><char style="wj">Pien gin ma a ki i cwiny dano, en aye bedo ki tam maracu, cot, kwalo kwo, nek, abor,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" /><char style="wj">paro lim, bal maracu, bwolo dano, kwele, nyeko, yet, wake me mingo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Tim magi maracu ni ducu gia ki i cwiny dano, gin aye gibalo dano.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niye pa dako me Curo-poiniki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yecu ocako a ki kunu, ocito wa i lobo matye cok ki Turo ki Cidon. Ci odonyo i ot mo kunu; onongo en pe mito ni ngat mo onge ni etye kunu, ento en pe twero kane. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Cutcut dako mo ma nyare tye ki cen owinyo pire, ci obino oryebe katyene. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Dako meno onongo Lagrik, ma roke Curo-poiniki. Ocako lego Yecu ni oryem cen woko ki ikom nyare. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Kong iwek lutino gukwong yeng, pe ber kikwany cam pa lutino, kibol ki gwogi.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Dako meno odok iye ni, “Rwoda, meno iwaco kakare; kadi bed kumeno ci lutino gwogi ma gitye ite meja gin bene gicamo ngide cam pa lutino do!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Pi lok ma iloko ni, ber dong idok paco, cen dong otyeko a woko ki ikom nyari.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />En odok paco, ci onongo latin tye obutu iwi kitanda, ma cen dong otyeko oa woko ki ikome.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano ma ite oding ma telebe oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yecu oa ki i lobo ma cokcok ki Turo, ci owok ki i Cidon, ka okato ocito wa i nam Galilaya, ka otuc kwede wa i dye lobo Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ci gikelo bote dano ma ite oding ma te lebe oto. Gin gucako bako doggi bote ni oket cinge ikome. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yecu ocako mako en ki ikin lwak otere cen i mung. Ocako keto cinge i it dano meno, ka ongulu laa ci ogudu lebe. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yecu oneno malo i polo, ocur, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Eppata,”</char> ma teloke ni, <char style="wj">“Yabe.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ite oyabe woko ki telebe bene ogonye, ocako lok atir. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yecu ocikogi ni pe gutit ki ngat mo; ento kadi bed ocikogi kumeno, gin bene gumede ameda ki tito pire. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Gin gubedo kaurune makato ducu, ma kun giwaco ni, “En otimo gin ducu maber; pien omiyo jo ma itgi oding owinyo lok, ki jo ma telebgi oto giloko.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo cam ki jo alip angwen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ikare meno, ka lwak dok gucoke mapol, kun pe gitye ki gin acama, ci Yecu olwongo lupwonyene bote, ocako waco botgi ni, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" /><char style="wj">“Kica maka ikom lwak man, pien gutyeko bedo kweda kany pi nino adek ma kun pe gitye ki gin acama mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" /><char style="wj">Ka acwalogi ni gudok wa tugi ki kec, ci kec bibwoyogi woko i yoo, pien jo mukene ikin gi gua ki kamabor.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Lupwonyene gudok iye ni: “Dano mo, twero miyo mugati maromo jo man i tim kany ningning?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye ki mugati adi?”</char> Gugamo ni, <char style="wj">“Abiro.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ociko lwak ni gubed piny i ngom. Omako mugati abiro ni, opwoyo, ka obaro igi, ocako miyo bot lupwonyene wek guket inyimgi, ci guketo inyim lwak. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Onongo gitye ki rec matino manok bene. Yecu ka dong olego iye gum, ociko ni magi bene myero giket inyimgi. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Lwak gucamo nio ka guyeng. Gucako coko ngide cam ma oloyogi ni, oromo adita abiro mupong. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Jo ma onongo gitye kunu welgi onongo romo jo alip angwen. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ka ociko lwak, ci odonyo i yeya cutcut kacel ki lupwonyene, ocito wa i lobo Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luparicayo gulego pi lanyut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note> Luparicayo gubino bot Yecu ci gucako pyem kwede, kun gimito lanyut ma a ki bot Lubanga, me teme. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char></note> Yecu ocur ki i cwinye matek kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo dano me kare man gimito lanyut? Adada, awaco botwu ni, pe gibimiyo lanyut mo bot dano me kare man.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yecu oa woko ki botgi, ci odonyo i yeya, ongolo nam okato wa loka ca.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tobi pa Luparicayo ki tobi pa Kerode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Lupwonyene wigi onongo owil woko ka tero mugati, onongo gitye ki mugati acel keken i yeya. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref></char></note> Yecu ocikogi matek tutwal kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom tobi pa Luparicayo ki tobi pa Kerode.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Lupwonye gubedo ka laro lok keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Pe watye ki mugati.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ka Yecu ongeyo ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wubedo ka laro lok ni pe wutye ki mugati? Peya wuniang ce? Pe wumako maber? Cwinywu pud nwang?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eje 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wutye ki wangwu, ci pe wuneno kwede? Wutye ki itwu, pe wuwinyo kwede? Wun pe wupo ce?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" /><char style="wj">Ka yam abaro i mugati abic pi jo alip abic ni, ci wucoko ngide aduku adi?”</char> Gugamo ni, “Apar wiye aryo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" /><char style="wj">“Ka yam abaro i mugati abiro pi jo alip angwen ni, onongo wucoko ngide opongo adita adi?”</char> Dok gugamo ni, “Abiro.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />En openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Peya wuniang aye?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latowang i Betecaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Gin gucako bino i Betecaida, ci jo mogo gukelo bote laco ma wange oto woko, gubako doggi ni obong kome. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yecu ocako mako cing laco ma wange otoni, ci otere woko wa inge gang. Ongulu laa i wange, ka dok oketo cinge ikome, ci openye ni, <char style="wj">“Ineno gin mo dong?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Laco meno otingo wange malo, ocako waco ni, “Aneno kom dano; ento pud ginen macalo yadi ma woto.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yecu dok onwoyo keto cinge iwang lawange oto. Ci wange odok kakare maneno piny maber. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yecu ocwalo en wa i paco tugi, kun cike ni, <char style="wj">“Pe idony ikin gang ma kunu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero otucu lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yecu ki lupwonyene gucito ikin gangi me Cecaria Pilipi. Ikare ma gitye i yoo, en openyo lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Dano mono giwaco ni an anga kaa?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char></note> Guwaco ni, “Jon Labatija; jo mogo giwaco ni, ‘Eliya’, ki jo mukene ni in ngat acel ikin lunebi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jon 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note> Dok openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Ento wun kono wulwonga mono ni an anga?”</char> Petero ogamo ni, “In i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ci Yecu ocikogi matek ni pe gutit pire ki dano mo.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi tone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yecu ocako pwonyo lupwonyene ni: <char style="wj">“Wod pa dano myero olim can madwong, dok ludongo ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik myero gukwere woko. Gin bineke, ento en bicer woko inge nino adek.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yecu oloko lok meno atyer kamaleng. Ci Petero otero en cen, ocako juke matek. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yecu oloke bot lupwonyene ci ojuku Petero ki tek, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“A woko ki inyima, in Catan! Pien tami pe lubu pa Lubanga, ento pa dano.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu olwongo lwak bote kacel ki lupwonyene, ci otito botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kace dano mo mito lubu kora, myero okwong kwere kekene, ka ocak tingo yatariyane, olub ki kora.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien dano ma mito laro kwone birwenyone arwenya, ento ka dano mo orwenyo kwone pira ki pi lok me Kwena Maber, en aye bilaro kwone.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" /><char style="wj">Konyo dano ma olimo lobo ducu ki gin ango mono, kace kwone gikwanyo woko?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" /><char style="wj">Dano dok bimiyo kit gin ango ma ka kwone?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" /><char style="wj">Kace dano mo lewic omake ikoma ki iloka ikare man me bal ki weko Lubanga, Wod pa dano bene lewic bimake ikome ikare ma en bidwogo ki deyo pa Wone kacel ki lumalaika maleng.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Dok oloko botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ki wun ni, tye jo mogo ma gucung ikinwu kany ma pe gibibilo to wa ki acel, nio wang ma guneno ka ker pa Lubanga bino ki tekone.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kom Yecu oloke mapat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Ka nino okato abicel, ci Yecu otero Petero ki Yakobo ki Jon, ocako yito kwedgi iwi got mabor i mung gin ken gi. Kome ocako loke inyimgi, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ginarukane odoko tar ma wil, matar dok tutwal; pe tye lalwok bongo mo iwi lobo matwero lwoko lony matar marom meno. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ci Eliya ki Moses gucako nen botgi, gubedo kalok ki Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petero ocako penyo Yecu ni, “Lapwony, bedo kany ber mada; wek dong wayub bolo adek, acel meri, acel pa Moses, ki acel pa Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Onongo Petero pe dong ngeyo kit gin ma myero eloki, pien onongo lworo omakogi mada. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> Pol ocako bino ci tipune oumu komgi woko lipuk, ci dwon owinye ki i pol, ma waco ni, “Man aye Woda ma amaro; wuwinye.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Lupwonye gucako ngiyo piny oyotoyot, ci wanggi pe omedo ki neno dano mo, guneno kom Yecu matye kwedgi ni keken.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ikare madong gitye ka lor piny ki iwi got, Yecu ocikogi ni pe gutit loke bot dano mo ikom gin ma guneno, nio wang ma Wod pa dano ocer ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Lupwonye gumako lok meno, gubedo ka penye keken gi ni, “Cer ki ikin jo ma oto kono teloke ango?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref></char></note> Gucako penyo Yecu ni, “Pingo Lupwonycik gin waco ni, Eliya aye kong kwongo bino?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yecu otito botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada Eliya aye myero okwong bino, ka wek ocak dwoko jami ducu obed kakare. Ento lok man dok kicoyo ikom Wod pa dano pingo kaa, ni, myero en kong olim can madwong, ka dok ni, kibicaye matek?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" /><char style="wj">Ento dong atito botwu atir ni Eliya dong otyeko bino wa con, ci gutyeko timo gin ma gimito ikome, macalo yam kicoyo ikome.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango awobi matye ki cen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ka gubino piny bot lupwonye mukene, ci guneno lwak mapol gurumugi dyere, kun Lupwonycik gitye ka pyem kwedgi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ka lwak guneno Yecu, guuru en mada, gutware oyotoyot guringo ka mote. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubedo ka pyem kwedgi pi lok ango?”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ci dano mo acel ki ikin lwak ogamo doge ni “Lapwony, wayi onongo akelo woda boti. En tye ki cen ma pe loko, <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />ka tek cen omako i kabedo mo, ci tugi retone woko piny likung, ci bwoyo yenyo idoge, cako kayo lake bene matek, kun poyo kome lirikrik. Apenyo lupwonyeni ni guryem woko, ci ryemone oloyogi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yecu ocako gamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wun yalwak ma niye wu lam, abibedo kwedwu nio wa awene? Dok abidiyo cwinya ikomwu nio wa awene ba? Wukel en bota kany.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Gukele bot Yecu. Ka cen oneno Yecu, ci oyengo kom awobi meno, orete woko piny; ocako ngene i ngom ma kun bwoyo yenyo idoge. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yecu openyo wone ni, <char style="wj">“Two man obedo ka time kit man pi lwak kare marom mene?”</char> Wone ogamo ni, “Nia wa ka tinone. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Otemo neke woko tyen mapol; ikare mukene rete i mac kadi wa i pii gu. Kace itwero timo iye gin mo, ci tim ber, ikonywa do.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yecu ogamo doge ni, <char style="wj">“Kace atwero? Gin ducu twere ki bot dano maye.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Won latin ogamo doge oyotoyot kun dange matek ni, “Aye; kony niyena ma lam mo ni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ka Yecu oneno lwak giringo gibino bote, ci ogere iwi cen kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“In cen ma pe ilokoni, ma iti odingi, aciki ni, a woko ki ikom awobi man, pe dok idwog ikome matwal.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />En oredo matek, ci ocako jake ajaka ki tek, ka oa woko ikome. Awobini kong obedo macalo dano ma oto, omiyo jo mapol guwaconi, “En dong oto woko ada.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ento Yecu omako cinge, oile kwede malo, ci en ocung.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ma Yecu odonyo i ot, kama gubedo iye ken gi, ci lupwonyene gupenye ni, “Gin ango ma ogengowa ryemone?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kit cen macalo man pe ryeme pi gin mo, ento ki lega keken.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu dok otito pi tone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Gua woko ki kunu, gungolo ki i Galilaya. Yecu onongo pe omito ni dano mo onge pire, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />pien onongo en tye ka pwonyo lupwonyene kun waco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Wod pa dano kibimiye i cing dano; kibineke woko, ci en bicer woko inge nino adek.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ento gin pe guniang telok meno, dok gulworo penye.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anga ma ladit ikin gi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Gubino i Kapernaum. Ka gitye i ot, Yecu ocako penyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubedo ka laro lok ango i wangayo kekenwuni?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref></char></note> Gin guling alinga, pien gubedo ka laro lok keken gi i wangayo ni, “Anga mono ma rwome dit ikin gi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mar 10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> Yecu ka obedo piny ci olwongo jone apar wiye aryo, ocako waco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Ka dano mo mito bedo mukwongo, myero en aye odong cen inge luwote ducu, en aye obed latic ma megi ducu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Okwanyo latin mo, ci omiyo ocung ikin gi, ka otingo i kore ci okwako, ocako waco botgi ni, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Dano mo ma ojolo latin acel macalo man pi nyinga, meno rom aroma ma ojolo an; ka dok dano ma ojolo an, meno rom aroma ma ojolo ngat ma oorani.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma pe lakworwa nongo en lawotwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Jon owaco bot Yecu ni, “Lapwony, waneno ngat moni ka tye ka ryemo cen ki nyingi, ma en pe nywako wot kwedwa, ci wajuke woko.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ento Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wujuke; pien pe tye dano mo ma tiyo tic matek ki nyinga, matwero waco lok mo marac ikoma oyot.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11:23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ngat ma pe lakworwa, en aye lawotwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10:42</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaco ki wun ni, dano mo ma bimiyowu pii me amata i kikopo, pien wun jo pa Kricito, limo mote pe biloyo en kadi matidi mo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma omiyo dano poto ibal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />
    <char style="wj">“Ka dano mo omiyo ngat mo acel ma ikin jo magi matino ma guye an ni opoto ibal, ci bedo ber makato ducu ka kitweyo kidi rego madit i ngute ci kibole kwede wa i nam.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5:30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace cingi aye omiyo i poto ibal, ci tong ingun woko, twara ma idonyo i kwo ma cingi lakucel peke, ber makato ma giboli i Geena ma itye ki cingi aryo ducu, kun idonyo kwedgi i mac ma pe to.</char> [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><char style="wj">Kama kwidi ma camogi pe to, ki mace bene pe to.</char>] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" /><char style="wj">Kace tyeni aye omiyo i poto ibal, ci tong woko, twara ma idonyo i kwo ma tyeni lakucel peke, ber makato ma kono kiboli ki tyeni aryo i Geena.</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><char style="wj">Kama kwidi ma camogi pe to, ki mace bene pe to.</char>] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5:29</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kace wangi aye omiyo i poto ibal, ci kol woko; twara ma idonyo i ker pa Lubanga ki wangi acel, kato ma kono kiboli ki wangi aryo ducu i Geena,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Ica 66:24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">kama kwidi ma camogi pe to, ki mace bene pe to.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />
    <char style="wj">Dano acel acel kibilonyo ki kado me mac kit macalo kado lonyo gitum.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kado atwona ber, ento kado atwona ka odoko bot, ci dok kibiyubu ningning wek odok mamit? Wubed ki kado i iwu, dok wubed ki kuc kekenwu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom keto nyom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yecu oa woko ki kunu, ci obino wa i lobo Judaya ma loka Jordan, ci lwak dok gucoke bote; ocako pwonyogi doki, macalo kit pwonye tye kwede.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Luparicayo mogo gubino bote, ci gucako omo cwinye kun gipenye ni, “Cik miyo twero ni laco oryem dakone woko?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yecu ocako gamo doggi ma kun penyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Moses yam ocikowu ningning?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Nwo 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref></char>
    </note> Gugamo ni, “Moses yam omiyo twero ki laco me coyo waraga me laryem dakone wek, nyomgi oket woko.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Moses omiyowu cik meno pi cwinywu ma nwang.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aca 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento nia i acaki lobo ‘Lubanga oketo laco ki dako.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aca 2:24</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Pimeno laco weko wone ki mine, moko ikom dakone matwal.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><char style="wj">Ci gin aryoni dong gidoko kom acel.’ Gin pe dok gibedo kom aryo, dong gibedo kom acel keken.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" /><char style="wj">Gin ma Lubanga oribo kacel dano pe opok kin gi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ka onongo gitye i ot, ci lupwonyene gupenye ikom lok meno. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note> En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka laco mo oryemo dakone, ce dok onyomo dako mukene, laco meno otimo abor, nongo obalo inyim dakone;</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" /><char style="wj">ki dako bene kitmeno, kace oa woko ki bot cware dok ogero laco mukene, ci dako meno otimo abor.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo gum ikom lutino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ka lwak gukelo lutinogi bot Yecu ni wek en obong komgi, ci lupwonyene gujukugi. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ka Yecu oneno ci cwinye ocwer matek, ocako waco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwek lutino gubin bota, pe wugeng gi; pien ker pa Lubanga tye pi jo macalo gin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, dano ma pe oye jolo ker pa Lubanga macalo latin, pe bidonyo i kere kadi matidi mo.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ocako tingogi i kore omiyogi gum, kun keto cinge ikomgi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobi ma lalonyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ka Yecu oa obino wa i yoo, ci dano mo ocako ringo i kor, ci orumu conge inyime kun penye ni, “Lapwony maber, atim ango wek alim kwo ma pe tum?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yecu owaco bote ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo ilwonga ni aber? Pe tye dano mo maber, kono Lubanga kene aye ber.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Nwo 5:17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Nia 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Nia 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Nwo 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:16">Nia 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Nwo 5:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">e </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">In ingeyo cik, ni, ‘Pe ineki; Pe i tim abor; Pe ikwal gin mo; Pe ibed caden me goba; Pe ibum dano mo; Wor woru ki meni.’”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />En ocako gamo ni, “Lapwony, atyeko mako cik magi ducu nia wa i ka tinona.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yecu ociko wange onene ci cwinye omare, owaco bote ni, <char style="wj">“Gin mo acel aye pud orem boti. Kong icit icat jamini ducu ma itye kwede ci imii lime ki lucan, ci i bibedo ki lwak lonyo ma gikano piri i polo. Ka dong ibin icak lubu kora.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Awobi meno ka owinyo Yecu oloko bote kitmeno, ci wange obale woko, ocako dok cen ki cwercwiny, pien onongo en tye ki lwak lim madwong.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yecu olworo wange ci owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Bibedo tek mada bot jo ma lulonyo me donyo i ker pa Lubanga!”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Lupwonyene guuru lokenu matek. Yecu dok ocako wacogi ni, <char style="wj">“Lutino, donyo i ker pa Lubanga tek marac!</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" /><char style="wj">Kinaga twero donyo iwang libira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lujudaya lwongo apiding ni wang libira. Apiding aye dogola mading adada ikom cel. Tye pi dano ki lee matino calo dyel onyo romo keken.</char></note> oyot, makato lalonyo me donyo i ker pa Lubanga!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ci omiyo lwak guuru matek, ci gupenyo ni, “Ka kitmeno, ci anga dok ma lare?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yecu ocako nenogi, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ki bot dano pe twere, ento ki bot Lubanga twere, pien gin ducu twere ki bot Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petero ocako wace ni, “Ce wan kono ma waweko jamiwa ducu, ci walubu in ni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ki wun ni, pe tye ngat mo ma oweko ode, nyo omege, nyo nyimege, nyo mine, nyo wone, nyo lutino, nyo potine, pira ki pi lok me Kwena Maber,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" /><char style="wj">ma en pe bilimo lwak jami makato meno tyen miya ikare man, gin aye odi, omego, lamego, mego, lutino, ki poti, kacel ki ayelayela pa dano; ka dok wa ikare me anyim en binongo kwo ma pe tum.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13:30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Lwak jo mapol ma gin gubedo jo mukwongo yo aye gibidong cen, ki jo ma gudong cen, gin aye dok bitelo yo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu dok onwoyo tito pi tone tyen me adeke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ikare ma gitye i yoo ma cito Jerucalem, ma kun Yecu aye tye ka telogi yoo, guuru matek, dok lupwonyene gubedo ki lworo. En dok ocako tero lupwonyene apar wiye aryo, ci otito botgi gin ma bitime ikome, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />kun waco ni. <char style="wj">“Nen ba, wan dong watye kaito malo i yoo me cito Jerucalem. Wod pa dano dong kibimiye i cing ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik, kibingolo to iwiye, ci kibimiye i cing Lurok;</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" /><char style="wj">kibingale, gibingulu laa ikome dok kibipwode ki del, ci kibineke; ento en bicer woko inge nino adek.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Yakobo ki Jon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakobo ki Jon gin lutino pa Jebedayo, gubino inyim Yecu, ci guwaco ni, “Lapwony, wamito in i tim ki wan gin ma wamito legi pireni.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />En ocako penyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wumito ni atim ki wun kit gin ango?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Gugamo, ni, “Ye wek ngat acel obed kangeti tung lacuc ki acel bene obed kangeti tung lacam ikare me deyoni.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wungeyo gin ma wulego. Wun wutwero mato ki kikopo ma abimato kwede ni; onyo wutwero limo batija kit ma kibatija ki an kwedeni?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Gugamo ni, “Watwero.” Yecu dok owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kikopo ma an abimato kwede ni, wun bene wubimato kwede, ki kit batija ma kibibatija kwede an ni, wun bene kibibatijawu kwede;</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" /><char style="wj">ento lok me bedo ikom bada ma lacuc nyo me lacam pe an aye apoko. Meno bibedo pa jo mayam dong kiyubu pirgi wa con.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ka lupwonye mukene aparni guwinyo loke, ci cwinygi ocako cwer ikom Yakobo ki Jon. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note> Yecu ocako lwongogi bote, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wungeyo ni, jo ma kilwongogi ni gin lulo Lurok giloyo dano ki tek, dok luditogi bene gibedo ki twero ikomgi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pe myero wun wubed kitmeno; ento ngat ma mito bedo ladit ikinwu en aye myero obed laticwu,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" /><char style="wj">ki ngat ma mito bedo mukwongo ikinwu, en aye myero obed opiiwu ducu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" /><char style="wj">Kadi wa Wod pa dano bene pe obino ni ki tiine, ento en aye etii ki dano; en obino pi dyero kwone me bedo lakok dano mapol.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latowang ma nyinge Bartimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ka gubino i Jeriko, ci ikare ma en dong tye ka a woko ki i Jeriko, kacel ki lupwonyene ki lwak madwong, ci latowang ma nyinge Bartimayo, wod pa Timayo, ma en lakwac onongo obedo piny inget yoo. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ka owinyo ni meno aye Yecu me Najaret, ocako dange ni, “Yecu Lakwar Daudi, tima kica ba!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Lwak gujuke matek ni oling, ento en omede ameda ki dange ni, “Lakwar Daudi, tima kica ba!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ka Yecu ocung, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wulwonge obin.”</char> Gucako lwongo lawange oto ni, “Dong idii cwinyi, a malo, en tye kalwongi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />En otugi bolo ginarukane woko, ci oa malo, obino bot Yecu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yecu ocako penye ni, <char style="wj">“Imito atimi gin ango?”</char> Ci latowang ogamo ni, “Lapwony, amito wanga onen piny do.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yecu ocako waco ni <char style="wj">“Dong iciti, niye ni ocangi.”</char> Ocako neno piny cut, ci olubu kor Yecu kun woto kwede i yoo.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu odonyo i Jerucalem ki kwogo madit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ikare ma gin cok oo i Jerucalem, madong gin tye i tung Betepage ki Betania, ikor got Jeituni, ci Yecu ocako oro jo aryo ki ikin lupwonyene, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit i gang matye inyimwu. Kace wudonyo iye, ci wutugi nongo latin kana ma kitweyo, ma ngat mo peya oito iwiye; ci wugony, wek wukel.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" /><char style="wj">Kace dano mo openyowu ni, ‘Wugonyo woko pingo ka?’ Wudoke iye ni, ‘Rwot aye mito; en bicwalo dwoko cen kany oyotoyot.’”</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Gucako cito, gunongo kitweyo latin kana i dogola woko ki inget yoo, ci gugonyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Jo mogo ma onongo gucung kunu gupenyogi ni, “Wubitimo gin ango, ma wugonyo ki latin kana ni?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Gudok iye kit ma Yecu ocikogi kwede, ci guye ni gucit kwede. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ci gukelo latin kana bot Yecu, gucako peto bongigi ma meggi ikome, Yecu ocako bedo iwiye. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Jo mapol gupeto bongigi ma meggi i dye yoo, ki jo mogo gupeto jang yadi ma potgi oluk ma gin ojako ki i poti. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Jab 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note> Ci jo ma gutelo yoo ki jo ma gilubu kore gudange ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Ojana! Lubanga omii gum ikom dano ma bino inying Rwot!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Lubanga omii gum ikom ker pa kwarowa Daudi matye kabino ni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Ojana malo iwi polo!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yecu odonyo i Jerucalem, ci ocito i Ot pa Lubanga ocako, ngiyo kit jami ducu, ka odok i Betania kacel ki jone apar wiye aryo, pien onongo piny dong oyutu woko.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oceno yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Orwone dok gua ki i Betania, ma kun kec neke. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ka oneno yat oduru ki cen ma pote oluk, ci ocito ka nenone ni gwok nyo enong iye ma ocek. Ka oo i te yat, ci pe onongo iye gin mo, onongo pote keken, pien onongo peya kare me ceke.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Lupwonyene guwinyo ka en waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ngati mo dong pe ma bicamo nyiggi matwal.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olonyo Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ka gubino i Jerucalem, ci Yecu odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ocako ryemo lucatwil ki luwil jami i Ot pa Lubanga. En oryebo meja pa lulok cente, ki kom pa lucat amam; <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />pe onongo dok ye ni dano mo ongol i Ot pa Lubanga ki yec mo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ica 56:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note> Ka dok ocako pwonyogi kun loko ni, <char style="wj">“Pe yam kicoyo ni, ‘Oda kibilwongo ni ot me lega pa rok ducu’? Ento wun wuloko odoko boro pa luyak.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik gubedo kawinyo loke, ci gucako yenyo kit yoo mo me neke woko; pien gin gitye ka lworo en. Pien onongo lwak ducu gitye kauru kit pwonye. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ka piny oyutu, ci ocako a woko ki i Jerucalem.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ma oa ki ikom yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Odiko ka gitye kawot i yoo meno, guneno oduru meno otal cake wa i lwite. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petero ocako po pire, ci owaco ni, “Lapwony, nen yat oduru ma iceno ni otal woko.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wuye Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaco ki wun ni, dano ma biwaco ki got man ni, ‘Muke wek itinge ipot wa i nam,’ ma kun pe kalo akala i cwinye, ento nongo oye ni gin ducu ma elego ni bitime, ci bitime ada.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><char style="wj">Pi lok man mumiyo awaco ki wun ni, gin ducu ma wupenyo ma wulego Lubanga pire, ber wuye ni dong wulimo ci wubinongone ada.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Kace wutye ka lega inyim Lubanga, ka onongo wutye ki kop mo ikom dano mo, ci wutime kica, ka wek Wonwu matye i polo bene otimwu kica ikom balwu.</char> [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ka pe wutimo ki dano kica, ci Wonwu matye i polo pe bitimowu kica ikom bal mewu.”</char>]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom twero pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yecu ki lupwonyene dok gudwogo i Jerucalem. Ka onongo en tye kawot i Ot pa Lubanga ci ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik ki ludongo gubino bote. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Gupenye ni, “Twer mene ma omiyo itimo lok macalo man? Dok anga mumiyi twero meno?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“An kong apenyowu ki peny mo acel; wek wun bene wudoka iye, ci an bene abititowu kit twero ma omiyo atiyo lok man.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Batija pa Jon twerone oa ki bot Lubanga nyo oa ki bot dano? Wun wudoka iye.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Gucako bedo ki pyem ikin gi keken gi, kun gipyem ni, “Ka koni wawaco ni, ‘Twerone oa ki bot Lubanga’, ci en dok bipenyowa ni, ‘Ci pingo pe wuye loke?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ka dok wawaco ni twerone oa ki bot dano kono?” Ento gin gulworo lwak, pien lwak ducu gingeyo maber ni, Jon aye lanebi atika. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Wan pe wangeyo.” Yecu bene owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“An bene pe abitito botwu kit twero ma omiyo atiyo man.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lugwok poto olok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Ica 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu ocako lok kwedgi i carolok ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo ma opito olok i potone, ci orumu woko ducu ki cel, ka okwinyo bur me biyo pige, ci ogero iye lubele, oweko i cing lupur, ci ocito woko wa i lobo mukene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Ka kare me pwono nyig olok dong oromo, ci ocako cwalo latice bot lupur kaomo nyige ma oceke ki i potone.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Lupur gumake, ci gupwode, ka guryeme kwede woko, omedo ki dok ki cinge nono.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" /><char style="wj">En dok ocwalo latice mukene; gin gugoyo en bene, gugoyo wiye lero, gutime ki kit tim me lewic.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Ka dok omede oro dano mukene, ci guneko dano meno woko. Gubedo kaketo can ikom jo mapol; jo mukene gupwodogi apwoda, ki mukene gunekogi aneka.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" /><char style="wj">Pud onongo en odong ki dano acel bote, en aye wode acel ma en maro. Lacen en ocwalo wode kikome botgi, kun waco ni, ‘Kibiworo woda.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" /><char style="wj">Lupur gucako lok keken gi ni, ‘Man aye dong lale lim; wubin waneke woko, wek lim aleyane ni obed mewa.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><char style="wj">Ci gumake, guneke woko, gubole woko wa inge poto olok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" /><char style="wj">Ci won poto olok bitimogi ningning? En bibino, ci neko lupur woko ducu, ci miyo poto olok woko bot jo mukene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Jab 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Yam pe wukwano lok ma kicoyo i ginacoya ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Got ma lugedo gukwero ni en aye odoko got madit ma pire tek;</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />
    <char style="wj">man Rwot aye ma otiyo, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">obedo botwa lok me aura?’”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Lutela pa Lujudaya gutemo mako Yecu, ento gulworo lwak, pien guniang atir ni obolo carolok meno ikomgi. Ci gua gucito gigi woko.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Culu mucoro bot Cecar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Gin gucako oro Luparicayo ki jo pa Kerode bene, wek kimak lok ma a ki idoge. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ka gin gubino bote, ci gucako waco ni, “Lapwony, wan wangeyo ni in i dano ma itye ki ada, dok pe ito ikom ngat mo, pien in pe ineno kom dano ki woko, in ipwonyo yo pa Lubanga ki ada. Cikwa ye ni gicul mucoro bot Cecar nyo pe? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Wacul nyo pe wacul?” Yecu ongeyo raccwinygi, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun mono wutema pingo kaa? Kong wucikela kom lim ma kiculu kwede wek anen.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Gin gucako kelone bote, ci en openyogi ni, “Cal ki coc ma kicoyo ikomeni pa anga?” Ci gugamo ni, “Pa Cecar yo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ci Yecu ocako waco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Wudwok jami pa Cecar bot Cecar, ki jami pa Lubanga wudwok bot Lubanga.”</char> Gin gucako urune matek.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom cer ki ikin jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Tic 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lucadukayo gucako bino bot Yecu; gin aye jo ma giwaco ni cer pa jo ma oto pe tye kulu. Gucako penyo peny ni, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nwo 25:5</ref></char></note> “Lapwony, Moses yam ocoyo ni, ka laco mo oto woko, ce oweko dakone, ma kun pe obwoto latin mo, ci omyero omine olak dakone, wek onywal kwede lutino ka wi omine. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ci yam onongo tye omego abiro. Ngat mukwongo nyomo dako meno oto woko ma pe obwoto latin mo, <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />ci me aryo ocako lako dako ni, en bene oto woko ma pe obwoto latin mo; ki dano me adeke bene kitmeno; <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />ci gin ducu abiro pe gubwoto latin mo. Lacene en dako bene oto woko. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ikare me cer ki ikin jo ma oto, dako ni dong bibedo dako pa anga? Pien gin co abironi ducu gubedo kwede.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yecu ocako wacogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wurwenyo pi lok man, pien wukwiya ginacoya, wa tek pa Lubanga bene wukwiya.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Kace dano gibicer woko ki ikin jo ma oto, ci dong pe gibinyome, dong gibibedo macalo lumalaika ma i polo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Nia 3:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ikom lok man me cer ki ikin jo ma otoni, wun pe wukwano i buk pa Moses, kama ocoyo lok ikom caka, ki kit ma Lubanga yam oloko kwede ni, ‘An Lubanga pa Abraim, ki Lubanga pa Icaka, ki Lubanga pa Yakobo’?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" /><char style="wj">En pe Lubanga pa jo ma oto ento en Lubanga pa jo makwo; wun wungak wurwenyo woko marac.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik madit makato ducu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka Lapwonycik mo obino cok, ci obedo kawinyo ka gilaro lok. Ka oneno kit ma Yecu dok iye ki gin lok maber ma atir, ocako penyo Yecu ni, “Cik mene madite mukwongo ki ikom lwak cik ducu?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Nwo 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char></note> Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Cik mukwongo en ene, ‘Wuwiny wun jo Icrael, Rwot Lubangawa en Rwot acel.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" /><char style="wj">Ci mar Rwot Lubangani ki cwinyi ducu, ki tipuni ducu, ki tami ducu ki teki ducu.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ki me aryone en ene ni, ‘Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.’ Pe dok tye kit cik mo ma pire tek makato cik magi aryo ni.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Nwo 4:35</ref></char></note> Lapwonycik ogamo ni, “Iloko kakare, Lapwony; iloko atir ni, Lubanga tye acel, pe dok tye Lubanga mo mukene, kono en kene. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Koc 6:6</ref></char></note> Dok ni kimare ki cwiny ducu, ki ryeko ducu, ki tek ducu, ki maro lawoti macalo imare keni, cik magi aye pirgi tek makato gitum ma giwango ducu ki bere ki gitum mukene ducu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ka Yecu oneno ni odok iye maber ki ryeko, ocako dok waco ni, <char style="wj">“In pe ibor ki ker pa Lubanga.”</char> Lacen pe dok tye dano mo ma oete ka penye ki lok mo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom lakwar Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ka Yecu onongo tye ka pwony i Ot pa Lubanga, ci openyo ni, <char style="wj">“Lupwonycik mono gitwero waco ni Kricito en lakwar Daudi ningning?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ki tung bot Daudi kikome en oloko i tek pa Cwiny Maleng ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">‘Rwot owaco bot Rwoda ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">Bed itung bada ma lacuc,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">i kabedo me deyo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">nio ka abiketo lukwori piny ite tyeni.’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />
    <char style="wj">Kace en Daudi aye yam olwonge ni Rwot, ci en dok bedo lakware ningning?”</char> Lwak mapol guwinyo loke ki yomcwiny madwong mada.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otucu pi can ma bipoto ikom Lupwonycik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ikare ma Yecu tye ka pwonyo dano, owaconi, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom Lupwonycik ma gimaro wot ma guruku bongi maboconi, dok gimito dano gubed ka motogi wa i cuk gu,</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" /><char style="wj">dok gimaro bedo iwi kom pa ludito ka gitye i kacoke, dok gimaro bedo i kabedo me deyo i karama.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Gin gimayo odi pa mon to, dok gibedo kalego lega maboco me buta keken. Kibingologi kop madit makato ducu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot ma dato omiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yecu obedo i Ot pa Lubanga kama okeme ki canduk me coko lim, ci obedo kaneno kit ma lwak gibolo ki motgi i canduk lim; lwak lulonyo gubolo iye mapol. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ento dato ma lacan obino ci obolo iye cente mola ma nyige gin aryo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cente ma dato man obolo rwate ki peny acel pa jo Britic.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ocako lwongo lupwonyene bote, ci owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, dato man ma lacan ni en aye dong obolo lim madwong makato jo ducu;</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" /><char style="wj">pien jo mapol gugito ki i but limgi madwong ni aye gubolo, ento en i cane ni, obolo lime ducu ma en tye kwede ma onongo konyo kwone.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi muku Ot pa Lubanga woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ka Yecu okato woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga; ci ngat acel mo ki ikin lupwonyene owaco bote ni, “Lapwony, nen kit ma godi magi dito kwede ki kit ma gedone beco kwede!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wuneno gedo magi madito tutwal ni? Godi ducu kibimukugi kiretogi woko piny, pe kibiweko got acel mo kany ma odode iwi wadi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acaki te can ma bipoto i lobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yecu ka obedo piny iwi got Jeituni, kun otike ki Ot pa Lubanga, ci Petero ki Yakobo ki Jon ki Anderiya gucako penye i mung ni, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tit botwa, lok man bitime wa awene, dok kit gin ango ma binyutu ni lok meno dong cok cobe kakare?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yecu ocako wacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke, pe wuwek ngat mo obwolwu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" /><char style="wj">Pien jo mapol gibibino inyinga, ma giwaco ni, ‘An aye Kricito!’ Ci gibibwolo jo mapol.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Dok ka wubiwinyo pi mony, ki lok ma yweko pi mony, pe wuwek cwinywu opoti; myero kong meno otime, ento nongo nino me agik pud peke.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" /><char style="wj">Pien rok bilweny ki rok wadi, ki ker bene bilweny ki ker wadi, ki oyengyeng biyengo lobo i kabedo mapol, ki kec bene bipoto; meno gin aye acaki me te can ma bipoto i lobo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ento wun aye myero wugwoke kenwu; pien kibiterowu i Otkot, dok kibigoyowu i kacoke bene. Wubicung inyim luloc ki luker bene pira, wubitito lok me caden botgi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" /><char style="wj">Myero kong gikwong tito lok me Kwena Maber bot rok ducu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" /><char style="wj">Ento ka kiterowu i Otkot wek kingol kop ikomwu, pe wubed ka tamo kit lok ango ma wubilokone, ento wulok gin ma kibimiyowu i cawa meno; pien pe wun aye wubilok, ento Cwiny Maleng aye bilok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" /><char style="wj">Omego en aye bimiyo omine wek kinek woko, ki wego bimiyo latine wek kinek woko, lutino bitube ikom lunyodogi, wek kinek lunyodogi woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Dano ducu gibikwerowu pira ento ngat ma odiyo cwinye nio wa i agik, en aye bilare.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can madit atika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Ka wuneno kikelo gin mo me kwer, malik, kiketo i kabedo ma myero pe giket iye (wek dano ma kwano oniang) ci jo ma i Judaya myero guring woko wa iwi godi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dano ma nongo tye iwi ot pe dok olor piny, pe bene odony i ot ka kwanyo iye gin mo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" /><char style="wj">ki dano matye wa i poto pe odok cen paco kaomo ginarukane.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" /><char style="wj">Dok mon ma giyac gibineno can ikare meno, ki mon ma gidoto lutino bene!</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" /><char style="wj">Wuleg wek pe obin otime ikare me cwir.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Niy 7:14</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ikare meno bibedo iye twon can madit atika mayam peya onen i lobo, nia wa i acaki lobo ma Lubanga oketo ni, nio kwede wa onyo, dok bene pe binen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" /><char style="wj">Kono nene Rwot pe ojwiko nino meno obedo manok mo, kono dano mo pe obwot; ento pi jo ma giyero, ma en oyerogi, omiyo en ojwiko wel nino obedo manok.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />
    <char style="wj">Ikare meno kace dano mo biwaco botwu ni, ‘Nen, Kricito ma Lubanga oyero tye kany’, nyo ni, ‘Nen en tye kuca’, pe wuye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" /><char style="wj">Kricito ma lugoba kacel ki lunebi gu ma lugoba gibibino, gibinyutuwu lanyut kitiyo jami tango, wek girweny jo mapol ka gitwero, wek girweny wa ki jo ma giyero bene.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" /><char style="wj">Ento wun aye wugwoke, pien dong atyeko titowu con gin ma bibedo i anyim.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma Wod pa dano bidwogo kwede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Niy 6:12</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ento ikare meno ki inge can maditi, bibedo kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">‘Ceng bicido woko macol licuc,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">ki dwe bene pe biryeny;</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:4">Ica 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Niy 6:13</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">lakalatwe bia ki i polo, gipoto piny</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">ki twer ducu ma i polo bene biyenge.’</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ka dong kibineno Wod pa dano kabino ki pol, ki twero madwong, ki deyo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" /><char style="wj">Ci en bioro lumalaikane ka coko jo ne ma en oyero, kun kicokogi ki i twok piny angwen ducu, nia kwede wa i agiki lobo nio kwede wa i agiki polo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />
    <char style="wj">Wupwonye ikom yat oduru, cutcut ka jange dong olot, ci pote luk, ci dong wungeyo ni oro dong cok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Ki wun bene kace wuneno gin magi tye ka time, ci wunge ni en dong cok, tye wa i dogola.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco ki wun ni, yalwak me kare man pe gibitum, nio wang ma lok magi ducu bitime.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" /><char style="wj">Polo ki lobo gibitum ento loka pe bitum.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat mo pe ma ngeyo nino kadi cawa meno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Ento nino meno ki cawa meno pe tye ngat mo ma ngeyo, kadi wa lumalaika ma i polo, kadi wa Wod, ento Lubanga Won kene aye ngeyo gire.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Wugwoke, wangwu obed twolo manen, pien wun pe wungeyo awene ma nino biromo iye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk 12:36-38</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Bedo rom ki dano ma ocito welo. Ka yam a weko gange, ci omiyo twero bot lutice, kun miyo ngat acel acel ki tice, kun ociko lagwok dogola ni obed ka kiyo piny.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" /><char style="wj">Ma omiyo wun wubed ka kiyo piny, pien pe wungeyo awene ma won ot bidwogo kwede; gwok dwog wi otyeno, nyo i cwiny dyewor, nyo okokgweno, nyo odiko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" /><char style="wj">Wugwoke, kace obino oyotoyot pe onongwu wunino woko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" /><char style="wj">Lok ma awaco botwu ni, awaco bot dano ducu ni: Wukii piny.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ludito gupiro lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Nia 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nino madito me Kato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska </char></note> ki me Mugati ma Tobi pe iye onongo odong nino aryo, ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik guporo lok me mako Yecu ki ryeko ka wek gineke. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Pien onongo guloko ni, “Pe omyero kimak inino madito, miyo lwak bituge.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwiro Yecu ki moo i Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jon 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare ma Yecu tye i ot pa Cimon ladobo, ma en dong tye ka cam, dako mo obino ma kun tye ki adomo moo nard kikome ma wele tek tutwal ni. Ocako turu dog adomo moo ne, ci oonyo iwiye Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ento cwiny jo mogo ocwer, ci gucako lok keken gi ni, “Pingo moo man kibalo abala? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Pien moo man kono nene kicato woko, kono nene okelo lim makato denari miya adek kulu, ka wek gimi ki lucan.” Ci gucako tuge ikom dako meno matek. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yecu ocako waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuweke obed mot, wuyelo dako man pingo? En otiyo gin maber tutwal ikoma.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Nwo 15:11</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien wun wutye kacel ki lucan kare ducu, dok wutwero konyogi ikare ducu ma wumito; ento an pe abibedo kwedwu kare ducu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />En otiyo gin ma en twero; dok en aye okwongo onyo moo ikoma me yika. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Adada awaco ki wun ni, i kabedo ducu ma iwi lobo kama kibitito iye lok me Kwena Maber, gin ma dako ni otiyo bene kibitito pire, wek obed me nipo pire.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda oye dobo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Juda Lakeriot, ma en dano acel ma ikin jo apar wiye aryo ni, ocito bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga pi miyo Yecu i cinggi. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ka guwinyo loke oyomo cwinygi, gucako cike me miye lim. Juda cut ocako yenyo kare maber ma eromo miyo ki Yecu i cinggi.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yecu ocamo cam me Kato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska</char></note> ki lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:1-30">Jon 13:1-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ikom nino mukwongo me nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi pe iye, ma kitumu iye latin romo me Kato, lupwonye gupenye ni, “Imito waciyubi kabedo kwene wek icam iye Karama me Kato?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ci en ooro lupwonyene aryo ki ikin gi kun cikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit wa i Jerucalem; ci wubirwate iye ki laco mo ma oyeyo agulu pii, en aye wulub kore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Kama en odonyo iye ni, en aye wupeny iye won ot ni, ‘Lapwony owaco ni, ot welo ma mera tye kwene, kama an abicamo iye cam me Kato,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paska</char></note> <char style="wj">kacel ki lupwonyena?’</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" /><char style="wj">Ci en binyutu botwu kicika ot ma malone, ma kipeto, kiyubu maber, ci wuyub ki wan kabedo kunu.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Lupwonye gucito, ci gudonyo i Jerucalem, gunongo kit macalo Yecu owaco botgi ni, ci gucako yubo cam me Karama me Kato kunu.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ka piny dong oyutu ci obino ki jone apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Jab 41:9</ref></char></note> Ka gubedo piny ci gucako camo cam, ci Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ki wun ni, ngat acel ki ikinwu bidoba, en aye dano ma camo kacel kweda.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Gin gucako kumu cut, kun dano acel acel penye ni, “An bo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Tye ngat acel ikinwu wun jo apar wiye aryo ni, en aye dano matye ka gweyo dek i atabo acel kweda ni.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="wj">Pien Wod pa dano tye kawot kit man pi cobo kit ma kicoyo ikome ni; ento dano ma dobo Wod pa dano ni bineno can! Onongo bedo ber ka dano meno nene pe kinywalo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cam me otyeno pa Rwotwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Kor 11:23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ka gitye kacamo cam, Yecu omako mugati; ci olego gum ikome, ocako baro iye, omiyo bot lupwonye, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Wugam man, man aye koma.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Dok otingo kikopo, ci opwoyo, ocako miyone botgi, gin gumato. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Nia 24:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note> Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Man aye remona me gin cike ma ocwer pi jo mapol.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco bot wun ni, pe dok abimato pig olok, nio wa ikare ma abicako dok matone manyen wa i ker pa Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ka dong gutyeko wero wer, ci gucito iwi got Jeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito ni Petero bikwere woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Jek 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun ducu wubitenya woko adong kena, pien yam kicoyo ni, ‘Abigoyo lakwat, ci romi gibiket woko ata.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento lacen ka dong acer woko ci abitelo nyimwu me cito i Galilaya.” </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petero ogamo ni, “Kadi ka jo mukene ducu gibitenyi woko, ento an pe abitenyi ata.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yecu owaco bot en ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ni, tin ki i dyewor, ma nongo twon gweno peya onwoyo koko kiryo, nongo in dong ityeko kwera woko tyen adek kulu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ento Petero dok ogamo matek tutwal ni, “Twara ma ato kacel kwedi, pe abikweri.” Gin ducu gucako loko kitmeno bene.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olego Lubanga i poto Gececemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:36-39">Mat 23:36-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Gucito i kabedo ma nyinge Gececemane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gececemane tye iwi got Jeituni. Yecu ki lupwonyene onongo gin maro cito kalega kunu.</char></note> ci ociko lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kong wubed kany, an kong acit aleg Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ci ocako kwanyo Petero ki Yakobo ki Jon ocito kwedgi. Cwinye ocako poto matek ki kumu bene madwong. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ocako waco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“An cwinya tye ka wang matek, mito neka woko. Wubed ka kiyo piny kany.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ocito anyim manok, ci ogungu oryebe piny olego ni,<figure style="fig" alt="Jesu praying in the garden of Gethsemane" file="CN01808B.TIF" size="col" loc="Mark 14:35" copy="David C. Cook" ref="14:35">Yecu tye ka lega i poto me Gececemane</figure> “Kace twere, lakit cawa ni dong oa woko ki ikoma.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ci olego ni, <char style="wj">“Abba, Wora, jami ducu twere ki boti; kwany kikopo man woko ki ikoma; pe obed kit macalo an amito, ento obed kit ma in i mito.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ka odwogo botgi onongo gunino woko, ci owaco bot Petero ni, <char style="wj">“Cimon, inino woko ce? Pe itwero kiyo piny pi cawa acel mo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" /><char style="wj">Wukii, wuleg Lubanga, wek pe wudony i abita mo. Cwiny kikome mito loyo abita pa Catan, ento kom aye nyap.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Dok odok kalego Lubanga, kun nwoyo lego lega acel meno. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ka dok odwogo onongo gunino woko, pien onongo nino dong omako wanggi tutwal; pe dong gungeyo gin ma myero gudoke iye. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ka dok odwogo botgi tyen me adeke, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pud wunino ce? Pud wutye kayweyo bo? Dong oromo, ki cawa bene dong oromo; wod pa dano dong gimiyo woko i cing lubalo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" /><char style="wj">Dong wua malo, wacitu; nen dano ma doba dong tye cok.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimiyo Yecu i cing lumonene ci gumake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jon 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Cutcut ma Yecu pud tye kalok, Juda otugi tuc; en mayam onongo tye ngat acel ikin jo apar wiye aryo ni. En obino ki lwak ma gua ki bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik ki ludongo, kun gin tye ki pala lucwan ki odo gu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Juda ma ladobe ni onongo omiyogi lanyut. En owaco ni, “Dano ma abimoto kun anoto leme, meno aye en kikome; wutugi make woko, wutere kun wugwoke maber.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ka Juda obino ci okemo bot Yecu atir, ocako mote ni, “Lapwony,” ci onoto leme. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Gin bene gutugi poto ikome, gumake woko cut. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Dano mo acel ma onongo ocung ka ngete ocako woto pala lucwane, otongo ki opii pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, onguno ite woko. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubino bota ki pala lucwan ki odo gu me maka, macalo wubino ikom layak mo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Abedo ka pwony i Ot pa Lubanga jwijwi, ma kun abedo iye kwedwu, ci pe yam wumaka do. Dong wumaka, wek ginacoya ocobe kakare.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Gin ducu guringo woko, guweke odong kene.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobi ma oringo woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Awobi mo ma onongo odwalo cuka bongo keken ikome, olubu kor Yecu; gin gumake bene, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ento en opuce oweko cukane odong, ci oringo woko munero.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung i Otkot kapido</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:66-67">66-67</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jon 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Gutero Yecu bot ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, kun onongo ajwaki madito ki ludongo gu ki Lupwonycik gucoke kacel. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petero obedo kalubu kor Yecu ki cencen nio kwede wa idyekal pa ajwaka madit. Obedo ka oyo mac kacel ki lutic.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ajwaki madito ki jo ma i Otkot ducu guyenyo lok me caden ma omyero omak kom Yecu ma weko kineke; ento guyenyo kwe pe gunongo mo. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Lwak lucaden mapol gubedo ka kelo lok goba ikome, ma lokgi ducu pe rwate. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Jo mukene gua malo, ci gukelo lok goba ikome ni, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jon 2:19</ref></char></note> “Wan wawinyo ka en loko ni, ‘An atwero muku Ot pa Lubanga ni woko, mayam kigero ki cing ngi, ci dok agero mukene inino adek keken, ma pe gitiyo ki cing.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kadi bed gukelo lok goba kitmeno, ento lok ma gukelo pe gin rwate.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ajwaka madit otire malo ci ocung idyere, ocako penyo Yecu ni, “Lwak adot ma lucaden gudoti kwede ni in igamo ningning?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yecu pe ogamo, oling gire alinga. Ajwaka madit dok openye ni, “In aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, Wod pa Lubanga ma kipwoyo ni bo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char></note> Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“An aye a en; dok bene wubineno ka Wod pa dano obedo ki Won Twer atena iwi kom me deyo ka ngete, tung acuc; ka dok bino ki pol me polo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ajwaka madit ocako yeco ginarukane woko kekene, kun waco ni, “Pud dok wumito kit caden ango kaa? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note> Dong wutyeko winyo kit ma en yeto kwede Lubanga. Wutamo iye lok ango dong?” Gin ducu gungolo loke ni, bale rome to. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Jo mukene gucako ngulu laa ikome, kun giumu wange woko, ka gidonge kwede, ma kun giwaco ni, “In ma lanebi ni, tuc ba!” Lukurpiny gujole kun gipale ki cinggi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwero Yecu woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jon 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ikare ma onongo Petero tye piny idyekal, ci angeca pa ajwaka madit acel mo obino kenyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ka oneno Petero ka oyo mac, <figure style="fig" alt="Peter warming himself by the fire" file="cn01817B.tif" size="col" loc="Mark 14:67" copy="David Cook" ref="14:67">Petero tye kaoyo mac</figure> ka obolo wange ikome ci owace ni, “In bene onongo itye kacel ki Yecu me Najaret.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Petero ocako kwero woko, ma kun waco ni, “An pe angeyo, pe bene aniang gin ma itye ka lokone ni.” Ka Petero okato woko i doggang, ci twon gweno otugi kok cut. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Angeca meno dok onene, ci dok ocako tito bot jo ma gucung kunu ni, “Dano man en bene ngat acel ma ikin gi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petero dok ocako kwerone woko aye. Kare dok okato manok mo, jo ma onongo gucung kenyo dok guwaco ki Petero ni, “Adada in i ngat acel ma ikin gi, pien in Lagalilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />En ocako kwonge kun lame kekene ni, “An pe angeyo dano man ma wun wuloko pireni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ci cutcut twon gweno okok tyen me aryone. Petero ocako po lok ma Yecu owaco bote ni, <char style="wj">“Ma nongo twon gweno peya onwoyo koko kiryo, nongo in dong ityeko kwera woko tyen adek kulu.”</char> Ci ocako koko ki cwercwiny madwong.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung inyim Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ka piny dong oru, oyotoyot ajwaki madito ki ludongo ki Lupwonycik ki jo ma i Otkot ducu, gupiro lok kacel. Ci gutweyo Yecu woko gutere kwede gumiye bot Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato ocako penye ni, “In i Rwot pa Lujudaya bo?” Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Iwaco kakare gire.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Ajwaki madito gucako dote ki lwak adot mapol. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato dok openye ni, “Pe kong idok iye ce? Pe ineno kit lwak lok mapol ma kidoti kwede ni?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yecu dok pe omedo ki dok iye lok mo, omiyo Pilato ouru matek.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingolo ki Yecu kop me to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ikare me nino madito onongo Pilato gonyo mabuc mo acel woko ma dano gulege pire. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ikare meno onongo tye laco mo ma nyinge Baraba, mayam kitweyo i buc ikin jo mujemo ma guneko dano ikare me jemogi ni. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Lwak gucako cito bot Pilato, gupenye wek otim kit mayam tiyoni. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato openyogi ni, “Wumito mono ni agony ki wun Rwot pa Lujudaya?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato onongo ongeyo ni ajwaki madito gumiyo Yecu bote pi nyeko. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ajwaki madito gupiyo lwak ni twara kigonyigi Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato dok openyo lwak ni, “Laco man ma wun wulwongo ni Rwot pa Lujudaya ni dong abitimo ningning?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Lwak gucako woo ni, “Gure woko ikom yatariya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato dok openyogi ni, “Pingo kaa, otimo kit gin ango marac?” Ento lwak gumede ki woo ni, “Gure woko ikom yatariya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pi mito kweyo cwiny lwak, omiyo Pilato oye gonyigi Baraba, ocako pwodo Yecu ki del, ka omiye wek kigure woko ikom yatariya.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acikari gungalo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jon 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Acikari gutero Yecu wa i dye kal pa laloc lobo matye i Jerucalem, ci gulwongo buca monygi ducu gucoke kacel. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ka gucako ruku Yecu ki bongo makwar, ka gudolo lalukana okutu, gurwako iwiye, <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />kun gimote ni, “Itye ba, Rwot pa Lujudaya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Gucako goyo wiye ki odo gayi, ka gungulu laa bene ikome, kun girumu cong gi me mine woro. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ka dong gutyeko ngale, ci gulunyo bongo makwar woko ki ikome, ka dok guruke ki bongine kikome, ci gutere kwede woko ka gure ikom yatariya.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiguro Yecu ikom yatariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gucako mako dano mo ma onongo obikato ma oa ki ikin gang ci gudiye katingo yatariya pa Yecu. Dano man nyinge Cimon dano me Cirene, won Alegijanda ki Rupo. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Gutero Yecu i kabedo ma kilwongo ni Golgota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Golgota onongo tye kabedo me neko lubalo. Piman cogo wic onongo pol ata kunu. Ki tung cel bene kabedo man bene kilwongo kitmeno pien got mo onongo tye kunu maka ineno, ineno cal ki okoto wic.</char></note>, ma teloke ni kabedo me cogo wic. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Gucako miye kongo bwino ma girubu iye yat murra; ento en okwero matone woko. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Jab 22:18</ref> </char></note> Ka dong gugure ikom yatariya, ci gupoko bongine woko ikin gi, kun gibolo kwir wek kinen bongi mene ma ngat acel acel bitero. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kiguru Yecu ikom yatariya i cawa adek me odiko. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Kicoyo i waraga gin ma nyutu lok ma kidote iye ni, “Rwot pa Lujudaya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Kigure kacel ki luyak mogo aryo, dano acel tung lacuc ki acel tung lacam. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ica 53:12</ref></char></note> Omiyo ginacoya ocobe kakare ni, “Kikwane ikin lubalo.”] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Jab 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jon 2:19</ref></char></note> Jo mayam gimol gikato ki ka ngete gubedo ka yete, kun giyengo wigi, ma giwaco ni, “Nye, in ma imuku Ot pa Lubanga woko, ci igero pi nino adek kekeni, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />dong ilare keni, a woko ki ikom yatariya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ki ajwaki madito bene gungale, ma giloko ki luwotgi kacel ki Lupwonycik bene, kun giwaco ni, “Yam bedo ka laro jo mukene, pe twero lare kene. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Wek tin Kricito, ma Rwot me Icrael, olor piny ki ikom yatariya, wek wanen ka wacak ye.” Wa jo ma kigurogi kacel kwede bene gucaye.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ka cawa oromo abicel, piny ocido woko macol i lobo ducu, nio kwede wa i cawa abongwen. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Jab 22:1</ref></char></note> Ikom cawa abongwen Yecu odange ki dwon malongo ni, <char style="wj">“Eloi, Eloi, lama cabaktani?”</char> Ma teloke ni, <char style="wj">“Lubangana, Lubangana, itenya woko pingo?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ka jo ma onongo gucung kunu guwinyo loke, ci guwaco ni, “Winyu ka en lwongo Eliya ca.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Jab 69:21</ref></char></note> Ci dano acel oringo, okwanyo amor, olutu i kongo bwino mawace, orwako iwi tal gayi, omiyo ki Yecu ni omati, kun waco ni, “Weku mono kong wanen ka Eliya bino ka kwanye woko ki ikom yatariya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yecu dok odange ki dwon malongo, ka oto.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Nia 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci bongo kicika ma i Ot pa Lubanga ocako yec woko opoke dul aryo, oyec ki malo, nio kwede wa i tere piny. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ladit maloyo acikari, ma onongo ocung cok inyime, ka oneno kit ma Yecu oto kwede, owaco ni, “Adada, dano man onongo Wod pa Lubanga!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> Dok onongo tye mon mogo ma gucung ki cen ka nenone; onongo tye Maliam Lamagdala, ki Maliam min Yucepu matidine ki Yoce, ki Calume. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Gubedo kalubu kor Yecu ki i Galilaya, gubedo ka konye bene, dok onongo tye lwak mon mapol ma gubino kwede wa i Jerucalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyiko kom Yecu i lyel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ikom nino me Yube, en nino ma inyim ceng Cabit, ki i otyenone, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yucepu me Arimataya obino; en yam dano madit ma lamemba me Otkot ma kipwoyo bene, en kikome obedo ka kuru ker pa Lubanga. En odiyo cwinye, ci odonyo wa bot Pilato, olego kom Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato ouru ka dong otyeko to woko oyot kumeno; ci olwongo ladit maloyo acikari, openye kace dong oto woko. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ka ladit maloyo acikari otyeko niango en, ci omiyo kom Yecu bot Yucepu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yucepu owilo bongo cuka matar, maryeny ni dangdang, ci okwanyo kom Yecu woko ki ikom yatariya, oboyo ki cuka meno, ka otero kome opyelo i lyel ma en okwinyo oroko i got, ci ocego wiye woko ki got ma oloro ki dog lyel. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliam Lamagdala ki min Yoce guneno kama kiyiko iye kome.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ka ceng Cabit dong okato, ci Maliam Lamagdala ki Maliam min Yakobo, ki Calume guwilo moo ma ngwece kur me wot kwede ka wiro kom Yecu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ikom nino mukwongo me Cabit mon magi gupuk odiko con ma ceng otuc, ci gucito iwi lyel. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Gucako penye keken gi ni, “Anga mono ma bidirowa got woko cen ki i dog lyel?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ka gutingo wanggi ci guneno got meno dong kidiro woko cen; onongo gote dit tutwal. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ka gudonyo i lyel, ci guneno latin awobi mo ma oruku bongo matar, obedo tung acuc; gucako urune mada. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />En owaco botgi ni, “Pe wubed kaurune; wun wutye kayenyo Yecu me Najaret ma kiguro ikom yatariya ni. En dong ocer woko, pe dong tye kany. Kong wunen kama kipyelo iye kome. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar 14:28</ref></char></note> Ento wucit wutit ki lupwonyene, ki bot Petero bene ni, en dong otelo nyimwu me cito wa i Galilaya; wubineno kome kunu, kit mayam en otito botwu ni.” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ci mon gukati woko ki i lyel, gucako ngwec ki myelkom pi lworo ma omakogi matek tutwal; lworo ogengogi tito loke ki ngat mo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yecu onen bot Maliam Lamagdala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jon 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ka Yecu dong ocer odiko con inino mukwongo me Cabit, okwongo onen bot Maliam Lamagdala, mayam en oryemo cen abiro ki ikome ni. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />En otugi tero lok bot jo mayam gibedo kwede, ikare ma gitye ki cola ki kumu ni. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kadi bed guwinyo ni en tye gire makwo, dok bene ni, otyeko nyute bot Maliam, ento pe guye loke.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu onen bot lupwonyene aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Lacen Yecu dok onen bot jo mukene ikit mapate, bot lupwonye ma onongo gicito kawot ikin gang. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Gin dok gucito gutito bot jo mudong ni, ento gin bene dok pe guye lokgi.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ociko jo apar wiye aceli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Tic 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ka lacen dong onyute bot lupwonyene apar wiye acel ma onongo gitye i dog cam. Ocako da ikomgi pi kwero ye lok, ki pi tekcwinygi, pien gukwero ye lok pa jo madong guneno kome inge cerne. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Tic 1:8</ref></char></note> Ka dong owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit i lobo ducu, wucitit iye lok me Kwena Maber bot ginaketa ducu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><char style="wj">Dano ma oye, ce gibatija en, ci bilare; ento dano ma okwero ye en aye kop biloye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><char style="wj">Lanyut magi binen ki bot jo ma guye: gibiryemo cen pi lwongo nyinga, gibiloko ki leb manyen,</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><char style="wj">gibimako wa twol gu, dok ka gibimato gin ma neko dano, ci pe bitimogi marac; gin bene gibiketo cinggi ikom lutwo ci gibicang.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oito i polo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tic 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tic 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka Rwot Yecu dong otyeko lok kwedgi, ci kitinge kitere woko malo i polo, ci ocako bedo piny kanget Lubanga atena i kabedo me deyo tung acuce. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ci lupwonye gucito katito lok i kabedo ducu, kun Rwot kikome bene tye katic kwedgi, kun moko lok ma gitito ki lanyute.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>